<title>UK: TABLE-Nationwide year profit falls 33 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Nationwide year profit falls 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to April 4, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Pretax		     264.8		  vs 395.6</p>
<p> Operating profit	 314.3		  vs 520.4</p>
<p> Total income	     827.7		  vs 1.01 bln</p>
<p>Note - Nationwide said figures for 1996 have been restated for changes in accounting policies with respect to goowdwill and mortgage cashbacks and discounts.</p>
<p>Full company name - Nationwide Building Society.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
